Tark: an offline new tab (spec 6.1). When the network is down, chrome://newtab
resolves to chrome://new-tab-page-third-party/, now Tark's page: the mark, a
search pill and "You're offline. Searches will run when you're back." The
address bar has focus on every new tab, so typing goes there.

